        "created_at": "2020-03-06T23:04:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wow! How are the heroes supposed to deal with 4 60ish Health opponents when they generally have around 30 (maybe)?&nbsp; It's not like they can do more damage than the villains or act more often.</p>",
