        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/eada6e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-03-06T23:25:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have no play experience, so I'll take your word for it; seems wonky on paper.</p>\n<p>I asked specifically about 4 villains, as I noted in my \"Sell Me Off\" thread, I'm looking to transfer an existing Champions game to SCRPG and the heroes have a nemesis team.</p>\n<p>As for variety, though, surely 4 villains has more variety than, say, an encounter with just minions and lieutenants, right? (But perhaps less than one with Challenges.)</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
