        "raw": "<p>I have no play experience, so I'll take your word for it; seems wonky on paper.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I asked specifically about 4 villains, as I noted in my \"Sell Me Off\" thread, I'm looking to transfer an existing Champions game to SCRPG and the heroes have a nemesis team.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As for variety, though, surely 4 villains has more variety than, say, an encounter with just minions and lieutenants, right? (But perhaps less than one with Challenges.)</p>",
