        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-03-06T23:29:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That depends on the Villains, really. You could make a scene with four villains all working on the same goal the same way, or have them approach it different ways. The end result will be a combination of what you make, and how the storytelling goes.</p>",
